<title>POLAND: Polish insurers results better in Q1 '97 - GUS.</title>
<headline>Polish insurers results better in Q1 '97 - GUS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish insurers' financial results improved in the first quarter of 1997, compared with the same period last year, a report by the Central Statistical Office (GUS) showed on Friday.</p>
<p>  ALL INSURANCE	Q1 1997	  Q1 1996     PCT CHANGE</p>
<p>(in million zloty)</p>
<p> gross premium	 4,135.33	 2,806.47	 47.2</p>
<p> gross profit	    468.33	     9.16 loss   --</p>
<p> net profit		287.50	    28.18 loss   --</p>
<p> total costs	   3,667.01	 2,817.66	 30.1</p>
<p>LIFE INSURANCE</p>
<p> gross premium	   946.17	   629.93	 50.2</p>
<p> investments	     861.68	   135.55	535.7</p>
<p> gross profit	    133.18	    54.94	142.4</p>
<p> net profit		 86.52	    37.93	128.1</p>
<p> technical result	105.18	    36.07	191.6</p>
<p> total costs	   1,687.13	   763.76	120.9</p>
<p>NON-LIFE INSURANCE</p>
<p> gross premium	 2,881.93	 2,045.37	 40.9</p>
<p> investement	     169.02	    89.09	 89.7</p>
<p> gross profit	    335.15	    64.10 loss  --</p>
<p> net profit		200.98	    66.11 loss  --</p>
<p> technical result	213.41	   155.79 loss  --</p>
<p> total costs	   2,053.90	 1,979.88	  3.6</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
